commit 080cef4a232664f29a330c8d0564a1cd6e5d400c

C03: the local player's finals quote the whole observed title in one sentence (MUSIC1595)

MUSIC1593 measured that «qué canción está sonando» read the local YouTube player but published no final: the first draft quoted a fragment («Greatest Hits (2)») of the observed title and the retries translated its bracketed duration, which the title checks rightly refuse; the stop finals came out as field reports («Estado de reproducción: "stopped"»). For a verified media.status or media.control observed on the local player, the composer now gives the whole-title `missing_name` hint that the playback finals already had, and instructs one natural sentence in the person's language — the title verbatim inside quotation marks, the state in words, no field list, no English status words, no artist unless observed, no translation of any part of the title.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


